{{ m.facts([
  { num: '3', label: 'Layers · front · back · background' },
  { num: 'Thousands', label: 'Open-source icons + letters + your photos' },
  { num: '7', label: 'Moods · from Minimal to Pastel, on one board' },
  { num: '64–1024', label: 'Transparent PNG sizes, all at once' }
]) }}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Three layers', title: "One icon shouldn't need<br>a design suite",
  shots: [ { src: shots + '01_overview.webp', alt: 'Editor — layers on the left, tools on the right, bottom bar', w: 720, h: 1616 } ] }) %}
  <p>Professional design tools overwhelm you from the first screen. Icon Maker cuts it down to three layers. Choose Front · Back · Background on the left, and the tools on the right style only that layer.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>Each layer keeps <strong>its own style</strong> — a gradient background with a solid icon and a shadow</li>
    <li>Top-left <strong>preview</strong> at real icon size; Swap exchanges front and back</li>
    <li>New · Open · <strong>Save</strong> · Export — keep editing a design later</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Content', title: 'Thousands of icons,<br>letters, even your photos', soft: true, flip: true,
  shots: [ { src: shots + '02_icons.webp', alt: 'Select Icon — icon font tabs and search', w: 720, h: 1616 } ] }) %}
  <p>Layer content is organized in tabs, and you can search icons by name. Tap an empty layer to open the picker right away.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Material Icons · Font Awesome · MDI · Material Symbols</strong> — thousands of open-source glyphs</li>
    <li><strong>System</strong> — letters or initials in your device fonts for a logo look</li>
    <li><strong>Photo</strong> — from your gallery or samples; double-tap for position, size, Fit or Fill</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Fill · Shape', title: 'Solid, gradient, photo,<br>and the shape you want',
  shots: [
    { src: shots + '03_fill.webp', alt: 'Fill — gradient preset palettes', w: 720, h: 1616 },
    { src: shots + '04_shape.webp', alt: 'Shape — width, height, radius sliders and shape picker', w: 720, h: 1616 }
  ] }) %}
  <p>Changes show up on the canvas instantly, so you pick while looking at the result. Set the base shape and size with sliders.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Gradient</strong> — linear, radial, sweep; presets like warm, cool, nature, sunset</li>
    <li>Rectangle · oval · triangle · star · diamond · hexagon · heart — a <strong>squircle or rounded square</strong> is one radius away</li>
    <li><strong>Transform</strong> to move, rotate, scale, skew; Perspective for a tilted 3D look</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Style ideas', title: 'Not sure about colors?<br>See variations on one board', soft: true, flip: true,
  shots: [
    { src: shots + '08_style_board.webp', alt: 'Style ideas — variations around your design and mood cards', w: 720, h: 1616 },
    { src: shots + '09_style_card.webp', alt: 'Card detail — compare with original, home screen shape preview', w: 720, h: 1616 }
  ] }) %}
  <p>Instead of tweaking the same design over and over, tap Style ideas and a board of variation cards built from your current design appears.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Around your design</strong> — back hue, background hue or front rotation, one change at a time</li>
    <li><strong>Moods</strong> — Minimal, Gradient, Clay, Glass, Neon, Luxe, Pastel</li>
    <li>Compare side by side and preview <strong>home screen shapes</strong> (Circle · Squircle · Rounded · Small)</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Export', title: 'Every size you need,<br>in one go',
  shots: [ { src: shots + '07_export.webp', alt: 'Export — size checklist from 64 to 1024', w: 720, h: 1616 } ] }) %}
  <p>Finished icons are saved as transparent PNG files, without resizing each by hand.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>Check sizes from <strong>64 × 64 up to 1024 × 1024</strong></li>
    <li>1024 for the store, 512 for the launcher, 64 for a favicon — <strong>all at once</strong></li>
    <li>Export several Picks from Style ideas together</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.more('See all features', 'Effects · Fill details · Style ideas · Dark mode · Who it\'s for') %}
  <div>
    <h4>Blur · Emboss · Shadow</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Blur — soft, natural blur</li>
      <li>Emboss — drag the light direction on a dial, then tune intensity and height for a raised look</li>
      <li>Shadow — fine control over position, color and blur radius</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Fill and editing details</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Solid — color picker or recently used colors</li>
      <li>Gradient — set start/end points and color stops yourself</li>
      <li>Photo — fill the icon shape with a picture · Stroke — outline color and thickness</li>
      <li>First launch starts with a sample icon and a quick guide</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Style ideas · Dark mode</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>The middle column is your current design</li>
      <li>Apply now can be undone right away; More like this explores closer variations</li>
      <li>Add favorites to Picks</li>
      <li>Built on Material Design, follows system dark mode — check how icon colors read on dark</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Who it's for</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>App developers — a custom app icon quickly before launch</li>
      <li>Designers — prototype ideas and experiment with color and style</li>
      <li>Everyone — personal profile icons and social media images</li>
      <li>Small businesses and brand makers — simple logos and stickers</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
{% endcall %}

